    },
    {
     "en": "Look at the electrolyte level against the plates.",
     "bn": "প্লেটের তুলনায় পানির লেভেল দেখুন।"
    }
   ],
   "references": [
    {
     "label": {
      "en": "Plates covered by ~5–10 mm",
